{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50230","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 滤水罗 · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 滤水罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经纬既纵横，偏承启沃情。\n含虚素心净，乐水智囊成。\n密㥀（致）[一]能藏垢，疏通自去盈。\n不问垂善滤，何问下流清。\n（[一]余疑「㥀」是「致」通用俗字，或音误。\n俞云：「校作『致』，较远，疑当作『慎』，因滤水罗正不必密致也。\n密慎与下文疎通对文。\n」按俞先生说较好。\n刘校与俞同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}